{"unit_id":"GuoMonth__dsh-erp#card-zh","repo":"GuoMonth/dsh-erp","commit":"c0403a20df035b6749e4fecc299816d3db331c3e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Adapt ERP 是面向 DSH 的 ERP 站点工作区插件，可在桌面和 Web 配置中使用。它把站点目录、会话工具、浏览器观察、学习控制器与本地知识存储接入 DSH。用户可从已登录页面建立最多三层的菜单和页面索引，读取分段摘要与证据，搜索和维护知识记录，并导入或导出经验分享包。每个站点使用独立工作区和索引，适合需要在日常 ERP 页面中查找菜单、字段和流程信息的使用者。运行需要 Node.js 24.18 以上且低于 25、浏览器环境和本地 SQLite；通过桌面插件命令安装后配置站点入口地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:136-146","src/learning/tools.ts:32-57","src/knowledge/tools.ts:91-107"]}
{"unit_id":"GuoMonth__dsh-erp#card-en","repo":"GuoMonth/dsh-erp","commit":"c0403a20df035b6749e4fecc299816d3db331c3e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Adapt ERP is a DSH plugin for ERP workspaces. It builds a three-level local index from signed-in pages and offers summaries, evidence, knowledge search, record maintenance, and sharing. Each site has a separate workspace and index. Requires Node.js 24.18–24.x, a browser, and local SQLite.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:136-146","src/learning/tools.ts:32-57","src/knowledge/tools.ts:91-107"]}
